       *> ACCOUNTS - record layout of Accounts (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY ACCOUNTS REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 551 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(194).
       *> Business (relationship, string)
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-BUSINESS PIC X(64).
       *> AccountType (raw, string)
           15 :P:-ACCOUNT-TYPE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-ACCOUNT-TYPE PIC X(64).
       *> AccountNumberLast4 (raw, string)
           15 :P:-ACCOUNT-NUMBER-LAST4-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-ACCOUNT-NUMBER-LAST4 PIC X(64).
       *> CurrentBalanceUsd (raw, float)
           15 :P:-CURRENT-BALANCE-USD PIC S9(10)V9(2) COMP-3.
       *> HasAch (raw, bool)
           15 :P:-HAS-ACH PIC X.
       *> HasWire (raw, bool)
           15 :P:-HAS-WIRE PIC X.
       *> HasCard (raw, bool)
           15 :P:-HAS-CARD PIC X.
       *> OpenedAt (raw, string)
           15 :P:-OPENED-AT-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-OPENED-AT PIC X(64).
       *> BusinessLabel (lookup, string)
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LABEL-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LABEL-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LABEL PIC X(64).
       *> TreasuryServiceCount (calculated, int)
           15 :P:-TREASURY-SERVICE-COUNT-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-TREASURY-SERVICE-COUNT PIC S9(18) COMP-3.
       *> HasAnyTreasuryService (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-HAS-ANY-TREASURY-SERVI-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-HAS-ANY-TREASURY-SERVI PIC X.
